<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <style>
        body { font-family: Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 1.6; color: #333; }
        .container { max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 20px; }
        .header { background-color: #f4f4f4; padding: 10px; text-align: center; }
        .content { padding: 20px; }
        .footer { text-align: center; font-size: 12px; color: #777; margin-top: 20px; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <div class="header">
            <h2>MFA Reset Rejected</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="content">
            <p>Hello,</p>
            <p>Your request to reset your Multi-Factor Authentication has been <strong>rejected</strong> by an administrator.</p>
            <p>Your current MFA setup remains active. If you still require assistance, please contact your IT support or administrator directly.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="footer">
            <p>This is an automated message from the Agentic CMS System.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
